BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//stu-bot//Daylight//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Daylight - Admin
X-WR-CALDESC:Filings\, insurance and the UK. Do not subscribe your partner 
 to this one.
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT12H
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT12H
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-fye@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260902
SUMMARY:Find your financial year end
DESCRIPTION:It is on your ACRA BizFile company profile. Every other deadlin
 e on this calendar hangs off it\, so nothing below is complete until you h
 ave it.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Find your financial year end
TRIGGER:-PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-health@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260828
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260829
SUMMARY:Health insurance - you have none
DESCRIPTION:NEXT's cover does not extend to you\, you hold an EP\, and ther
 e is nothing here. Largest practical exposure in your life and the cheapes
 t to close.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Health insurance - you have none
TRIGGER:-PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-pi@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260902
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260903
SUMMARY:Ask your PI insurer the territorial question
DESCRIPTION:One email: does this UK policy respond to work performed in Sin
 gapore by a Singapore entity\, for clients outside the UK? If not\, you ar
 e uninsured the moment the second client signs.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-nrl1@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260902
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260903
SUMMARY:NRL1\, and tell your mortgage lender
DESCRIPTION:Your mum lives there and pays rent\, so you are a non-resident 
 landlord. Without NRL1 the tax is withheld at source\, and it takes about 
 90 days to process.\n\nSeparately: most residential mortgages need consent
  to let\, and many lenders will not permit a let to a close relative at al
 l.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-ni@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260909
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260910
SUMMARY:Check your National Insurance record
DESCRIPTION:Voluntary Class 2 for periods abroad ended on 6 April 2026. Cla
 ss 3 is now the route at about GBP 18.40 a week. Gaps can normally only be
  filled six years back\, so every year you leave it\, one falls off the en
 d.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-firm@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260909
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260910
SUMMARY:Two quotes from corporate services firms
DESCRIPTION:A few hundred a month removes the whole category\, takes the di
 rector liability off your friend\, and keeps the PR evidence file clean.\n
 \nDirectors are personally liable for filing failures. That is him\, not y
 ou.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-sdl@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART:20260914T090000
DTEND:20260914T100000
SUMMARY:SDL - Skills Development Levy
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=14
DESCRIPTION:Payable on Employment Pass holders even though CPF is not. 0.25
 % of monthly pay\, minimum S$2\, capped at S$11.25. Due by the 14th for th
 e month before.\n\nRoughly S$135 a year. Trivial money\, real compliance i
 tem.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-ir8a@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
SUMMARY:IR8A to yourself as employee
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DESCRIPTION:Under five employees\, so the Auto-Inclusion Scheme is not mand
 atory.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-b1@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270416
SUMMARY:Personal tax - Form B1
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DESCRIPTION:18 April if e-filing. Also part of your PR evidence.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:admin-cs@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:Corporate tax - Form C-S
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DESCRIPTION:New companies get 75% off the first S$100\,000 of chargeable in
 come for the first three years.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
